{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:bandNotifEmptyBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "bandNotifEmptyBody", "text": "Apps appear here the first time each one notifies you while the relay is on. Nothing is missed in the meantime — the first ping is what puts an app on this list, and the second can buzz.", "sha256": "5021e5b0029a2c671314e8305427958d39edcd0dbf5c23f0bffb832ab9a527cf", "kind": "arb"}
